  "description": "<p>Scenario: directly accessing content in OCFL root on disk (for initial testing as well as restoration/portability)</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Cannot search in S3 except via known identifier</li>\n\t<li>Have to manually calculate the hash of the Fedora ID using a specific formatting of the Fedora ID in order to navigate to the OCFL object in S3 (info:fedora/the/id/etc)</li>\n\t<li>To simplify this, having the Fedora UI display the hash it generates for the persisted OCFL object will be very useful</li>\n</ul>\n",
